{"results":[{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-south-bay/140181/project","title":"The South Bay, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Mesacon Triumph Developers developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/mesacon-triumph-developers-11588.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# The South Bay Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![The South Bay Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![The South Bay Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-tower-view1-6451.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The South Bay Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-apartment-interiors1-2758.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹12.98 Cr - 19.82 Cr**\n\n₹74,419 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider The South Bay?\n\n## About The South Bay, Malabar Hill by Mesacon Triumph Developers\n\nThe South Bay, located in the prestigious Malabar Hill area, offers you a luxurious living experience. The project is situated at a convenient distance from the Eastern Express Highway and Vallabhabhai Patel Road, making it easily accessible from all parts of the city. This RERA-approved project provides you with a range of amenities such as power backup and a gymnasium, ensuring that you live comfortably and stay fit.\n\nThe project boasts of superior specifications, including master bedrooms with acrylic emulsion walls, making them stylish and durable. The beautifully designed apartments at The South Bay are available in 3 BHK and 4 BHK options, catering to the needs of families and individuals alike. Whether you re looking for a luxurious living space or an investment opportunity, The South Bay is the perfect choice.\n\nInvest in The South Bay today and experience the epitome of luxury living. With limited units available, we suggest you book your dream home at the earliest to avoid any disappointment. The South Bay is a must-visit destination for those looking for a life of comfort and sophistication.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at The South Bay:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1548 | 12.98 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 2207 | 18.01 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 2429 | 19.82 Cr |\n\nThis plush residential project is situated amidst a vibrant urban landscape, surrounded by numerous landmarks that cater to different needs and preferences. These landmarks not only add to the project s charm but also provide residents with a seamless blend of convenience and luxury.\n\n## The South Bay Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for The South Bay.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1548 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 12.98 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  2207 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 18.01 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  2429 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 19.82 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nThe South Bay's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | The South Bay | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 61200 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 61200 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 53250 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 53550 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nThe South Bay avg. price is ₹ 61.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [K Raheja Vivarea](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-vivarea/28107/project \"K Raheja Vivarea\") | ₹ 89,450 |\n| [Mesacon The South Bay](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mesacon-the-south-bay/111912/project \"Mesacon The South Bay\") | ₹ 82,350 |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| [K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-vivarea-mumbai/3470/project \"K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai\") | ₹ 74,950 |\n| Current Project **The South Bay** | ₹ 61,200 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In The South Bay | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for The South Bay.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for The South Bay moved from ₹ 53,250/sqft to ₹ 61,200/sqft, reflecting a 14.93% rise.\n\n## The South Bay Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1548 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The South Bay, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/the-south-bay-apartment-3-bhk-1548sqft-20234301124336.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 12.98 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 2207 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The South Bay, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/the-south-bay-apartment-4-bhk-2207sqft-20234301124358.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 18.01 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 2429 Sq. Ft. Apartment in The South Bay, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/the-south-bay-apartment-4-bhk-2429sqft-20234401124410.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 19.82 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of The South Bay\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of The South Bay to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![The South Bay Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-tower-view1-6451.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![The South Bay Apartment Interiors](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-apartment-interiors1-2758.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload brochure of The South Bay to explore floor plans and project details in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.\n\n### Project Brochure\n\nComplete details about the Project\n\n### Master Plan\n\nOverall project layout & design\n\n### Walkthrough Video\n\nVirtual tour of the property\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of The South Bay\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/leisure/am-ico-partyhal-active.svg)\n\n### Environment Environment\n\n![Environment](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/environment/am-ico-normalpa-active.svg)\n\n### Specifications\n\n## Location and Connectivity Around Mesacon Triumph Developers Malabar Hill\n\n![Connectivity map showing nearby places around Mumbai South](/assets/images/project-map.png?aio=w-714;h-317;crop;)\n\nEstimate commute from your office or kid's school to The South Bay.\n\n![Car travel mode](/assets/images/car-fill.svg)\n![The South Bay](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/the-south-bay-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Bm Ruia Girls' College\n\n#### Gavdevi Police Station\n\n#### Smt Motiben B Dalvi Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of The South Bay\n\n## How does The South Bay compare with similar projects?\n\n![The South Bay project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-the-south-bay-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [The South Bay](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/the-south-bay/140181/project \"The South Bay\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Costiera project in Breach Candy, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-costiera-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Lodha Costiera](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-costiera/3063/project \"Lodha Costiera\")\n\nBreach Candy, Mumbai\n\n![K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai project in Mahalaxmi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-k-raheja-vivarea-mumbai-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/k-raheja-vivarea-mumbai/3470/project \"K Raheja Vivarea Mumbai\")\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected 