mbai/project-image/tata-petit-towers-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPeddar Road, Mumbai\n\n3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 16.49 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About The South Bay\n\n### What types of configurations are available in this project?\n\nThis project offers 3 BHK and 4 BHK apartment configurations.\n\n### Are there any legal approvals and clearances for this project?\n\nThis project is Rera-registered with a valid certificate number P51900002722.\n\n### What is the distance to Eastern Express Highway and Vallabhabhai Patel Road from the project?\n\nThe project is connected to Eastern Express Highway at a distance of 3.5 km and Vallabhabhai Patel Road at a distance of 0.5 km.\n\n### What are the available unit sizes and configurations, along with their prices?\n\nThe available unit options comprise of 3 BHK apartments with an area of 1548 Sq. Ft. priced at 12.98 Cr and 4 BHK apartments with areas of 2207 Sq. Ft. and 2429 Sq. Ft. priced at 18.01 Cr and 19.82 Cr respectively.\n\n### Is the project fully constructed and ready for possession?\n\nThe project has a status of Ready to Move, indicating that it is fully constructed and available for possession.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/a